input.content:
{
  "name": "starter",
  "spawnLocation": 1,
  "startingItems": [
    "dagger"
  ],
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "dagger",
      "description": "A short, worn blade. Better than nothing.",
      "kind": "weapon",
      "attackBonus": 0,
      "attackDice": 4
    },
    {
      "name": "shortsword",
      "description": "A plain iron shortsword. Someone kept it oiled, a long time ago.",
      "kind": "weapon",
      "attackBonus": 1,
      "attackDice": 6
    },
    {
      "name": "leather armor",
      "description": "Cracked but serviceable leather.",
      "kind": "armor",
      "armorClassBonus": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "health potion",
      "description": "A cloudy red liquid.",
      "kind": "consumable",
      "healAmount": 10
    },
    {
      "name": "apple",
      "description": "A shiny red apple with a small worm hole in the side. It is the only thing in this place that grew above ground.",
      "kind": "consumable",
      "healAmount": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "bone",
      "description": "A gnawed bone. Heavy for its size, and cracked open lengthways by something with the jaw for it. There is still a little on it."
    },
    {
      "name": "shiny spoon",
      "description": "It is, unmistakably, a shiny spoon."
    },
    {
      "name": "tin whistle",
      "description": "A cheap tin whistle, gone soft-edged with handling and squashed a little flat at one end from riding in a pocket. A name is scratched down the barrel with a knife point, worn almost away: an M, and then something, and then what might be an R. Whoever they were, they had it on them the day they went into the rock, and it has not been above ground since."
    },
    {
      "name": "key",
      "description": "A heavy iron key. The wards on it are deep and simple: it was cut for one lock and no other.",
      "isKey": true
    }
  ],
  "monsters": [
    {
      "name": "goblin",
      "description": "A goblin crouches in the corner, watching you. It is thin, and armed with nothing, and it watches your hands rather than your face.",
      "hitPoints": 7,
      "armorClass": 12,
      "attackStrength": 1,
      "attackDice": 6,
      "inventory": [
        "bone"
      ],
      "respawnSeconds": 300
    },
    {
      "name": "cave troll",
      "description": "A cave troll blocks the passage, breathing slowly. Something iron hangs at its throat on a greased thong, about the size of a thumb — and strung on the same cord, absurdly, a little flattened tube of tin, far too small for the hands that are keeping it.",
      "hitPoints": 20,
      "armorClass": 14,
      "attackStrength": 3,
      "attackDice": 8,
      "inventory": [
        "key",
        "tin whistle"
      ],
      "respawnSeconds": 900
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "name": "The Hollow",
      "description": "You stand in a shallow hollow ringed by pale stones. The ground rises on every side to a rim of rotten shale — too loose to climb and too high to argue with. However you came into this place, it was not by a way you can go back up.\n\nCold air comes down from the cave mouth to the north. East, under the far overhang, the black shape of a camp nobody has used in a long while. West, a ledge stands above the stones.",
      "connections": {
        "north": 2,
        "east": 3,
        "west": 6
      },
      "interactions": [
        {
          "interactionId": "hollow-cache-open",
          "if": [
            "opened-cache"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*slab*",
            "*seam*",
            "*stones*",
            "*stone*",
            "*rings*",
            "*under*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "The slab lies tipped aside where you left it. The hollow beneath is empty now, and smells of dry earth."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "hollow-cache",
          "once": true,
          "scope": "player",
          "if": [
            "seen-pattern"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*slab*",
            "*seam*",
            "*stones*",
            "*stone*",
            "*rings*",
            "*centre*",
            "*center*",
            "*under*",
            "*dig*",
            "*pry*",
            "*lift*",
            "*rock*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "Knowing where to look, you find it: the flat stone at the centre of the rings, and the seam around it packed with old moss. It tips aside. In the dry space beneath, someone left behind what they could not carry any further — a shortsword, and a jacket of cracked leather."
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addItems",
              "parameters": [
                "shortsword",
                "leather armor"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addcondition",
              "scope": "player",
              "parameters": [
                "opened-cache"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "hollow-stones",
          "triggers": [
            "*stones*",
            "*stone*",
            "*slab*",
            "*rock*",
            "*under*",
            "*dig*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "The stones are cold and older than the hollow. They are not scattered — they lie in some order you cannot make out with your feet among them. You would have to get above them to see it, and there is a ledge west of here that stands over the whole floor of this place."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "hollow-left-for-you",
          "triggers": [
            "*who left*",
            "*left here*",
            "*left behind*",
            "*whoever*",
            "*next one*",
            "*before me*",
            "*came before*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "Everyone in this world wakes up here, and wakes up with a knife and nothing else. That is the whole of what the hollow gives you.\n\nSo anything else lying on this ground was put on it. Somebody walked back down out of that passage with the key already in their hand and the door already open, and spent the walk setting things down here instead of carrying them out.\n\nThey did not have to. Nothing made them. Check the ground."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "hollow-rim",
          "triggers": [
            "*rim*",
            "*climb*",
            "*shale*",
            "*scramble*",
            "*wall*",
            "*sky*",
            "*out of*",
            "*get out*",
            "*way out*",
            "*escape*",
            "*edge*",
            "*south*",
            "*back up*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You get a few feet up and the shale comes away under you in a sheet and puts you back down where you started. It is like that the whole way round: rotten rock standing higher than it looks, and no hold in it that holds.\n\nThere is one way out of this hollow that is not upward. It is a door, and it is in the rock somewhere past the cave mouth, and daylight is on the other side of it.\n\nEveryone who has ever stood here worked that out. Some of them are still in the passage."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": "Cave Mouth",
      "description": "The hollow narrows into a cave mouth. Cold air spills out of it.",
      "connections": {
        "south": 1,
        "north": 4
      },
      "monster": "goblin",
      "interactions": [
        {
          "interactionId": "mouth-goblin-fed-already",
          "if": [
            "fed-the-goblin"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*apple*",
            "*feed*",
            "*offer*",
            "*give*",
            "*share*",
            "*toss*",
            "*throw*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "It has your apple and you have its bone. It has gone back to its corner, and it is watching you again — but from a little closer than before, and not at the hands."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "mouth-goblin-feed",
          "once": true,
          "scope": "player",
          "if": [
            "carrying:apple",
            "monster:goblin"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*apple*",
            "*feed*",
            "*offer*",
            "*give*",
            "*share*",
            "*toss*",
            "*throw*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You take the apple out. The goblin's eyes go to it and stay there, and for the first time it is not watching your hands for what they might do to it.\n\nYou put it down on the stone and step back. It has the apple before you have finished stepping, and it eats all of it — core, pips, the little worm hole — crouched with one shoulder turned to you, the way people eat when eating has been difficult for a long time. Nothing that grew above ground has come down here in years.\n\nThen it does something you were not expecting. It goes through the heap beside it, picks out a bone with some weight still on the end, and pushes it across the floor to you with the back of its hand. A trade. It has plainly made them before.\n\nAnd it did not get these bones at the cave mouth. It goes in past the thing in the passage and it comes back out again, which is more than anyone else who has gone in there can say — and it does not manage that by fighting. It waits until the big one is down over something and busy, and then it goes carefully through what the big one has been lying on."
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "removeitems",
              "parameters": [
                "apple"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addItems",
              "parameters": [
                "bone"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addcondition",
              "scope": "player",
              "parameters": [
                "fed-the-goblin"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "mouth-feed-nothing",
          "if": [
            "monster:goblin"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*feed*",
            "*offer*",
            "*give*",
            "*share*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You have nothing on you it wants. It is not going to take a bone off you — it has bones, that is the whole of what it has. It is thin in a way that bones do not fix.\n\nThere was food in the camp east of the hollow: sift through the ashes of the firepit and it is there."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "mouth-apple-no-goblin",
          "triggers": [
            "*apple*",
            "*feed*",
            "*offer*",
            "*share*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "The corner is empty. Whatever was crouched in it is not in it now, and there is nobody at this cave mouth to give anything to."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "mouth-bones",
          "triggers": [
            "*bone*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "The goblin has been cracking bones open for the marrow and dropping them where it sits. They are not its own kills — they come up from somewhere further in, where something with a much larger jaw ate first and left the ends.\n\nA bone is a poor weapon and no kind of food. It is, however, exactly the thing a big hungry animal wants, and there is a big hungry animal north of here."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "mouth-goblin",
          "triggers": [
            "*goblin*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "It is not going to start anything — nothing down here starts anything — but it is between you and the passage north, and it has plainly been eating.\n\nIt would not take much killing.\n\nIt watches your hands, and it is worth being clear about why: not to see what you will do to it. It has already worked out that it cannot stop you if you mean that. It is watching to see whether there is anything in them."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": "Old Camp",
      "description": "An abandoned camp under an overhang: a firepit long cold, a windbreak of piled brush, and a scattering of belongings. Whoever built it built it to be come back to.\n\nNothing here is lying in the open. Whatever is left is down in the ashes, and it will take sifting for.",
      "connections": {
        "west": 1
      },
      "interactions": [
        {
          "interactionId": "camp-whistle-again",
          "if": [
            "played-the-whistle"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*whistle*",
            "*play*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You have already played it here, and the hollow has already given it back off the stones, and it will do the same thing every time because that is what stone does.\n\nThe place that gave nothing back is the passage. That is still true, and he is still there."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "camp-whistle",
          "if": [
            "carrying:tin whistle"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*whistle*",
            "*play*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You get a note out of it on the third try. It is thin, and far too loud under the overhang, and it goes out across the hollow and comes back off the stones and then there is nothing.\n\nThis is their camp. They built the windbreak and banked the fire and laid the wood in dry, the way you lay wood in when you are coming back to it. Then they went north with a whistle in their pocket and a name scratched on it, and the thing in the passage has been wearing it at its throat ever since, on the same cord as the key to the only door out.\n\nThey got as far as the troll. You got further. You are sitting in what is left of their evening, playing what is left of them, and the wood they cut is what put you back on your feet.\n\nIf you want them to have heard it, there is one place left to play it: the passage where they stopped. And whatever you have to say to them, you can leave it where you are standing — whisper it, or carve it. It will still be here when you are not."
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addcondition",
              "scope": "player",
              "parameters": [
                "played-the-whistle"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "camp-picked-over",
          "if": [
            "searched-camp"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*firepit*",
            "*belongings*",
            "*camp*",
            "*ashes*",
            "*ash*",
            "*search*",
            "*sift*",
            "*rummage*",
            "*look around*",
            "*apple*",
            "*potion*",
            "*spoon*",
            "*food*",
            "*supplies*",
            "*rags*",
            "*scatter*",
            "*loot*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You have already been through the ashes. What is left is rags, a broken strap, and the cold ring of the firepit — and wood enough, still, to build a fire and lie down by it."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "camp-search",
          "once": true,
          "scope": "player",
          "triggers": [
            "*firepit*",
            "*belongings*",
            "*camp*",
            "*ashes*",
            "*ash*",
            "*search*",
            "*sift*",
            "*rummage*",
            "*look around*",
            "*apple*",
            "*potion*",
            "*spoon*",
            "*food*",
            "*supplies*",
            "*rags*",
            "*scatter*",
            "*loot*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "Sifting through the ashes, you turn up a potion, an apple, and a spoon. Whoever camped here left in a hurry, and did not come back for any of it. The wood under the overhang is dry, and there is enough of it to build a fire and rest.\n\nThe apple should have gone over long ago and has not. It is the only thing in this place that grew in the sun."
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addItems",
              "parameters": [
                "health potion",
                "apple",
                "shiny spoon"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addcondition",
              "scope": "player",
              "parameters": [
                "searched-camp"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "camp-rest",
          "triggers": [
            "*rest*",
            "*sleep*",
            "*nap*",
            "*recover*",
            "*heal*",
            "*mend*",
            "*bandage*",
            "*sit*",
            "*lie down*",
            "*fire*",
            "*fre*",
            "*flame*",
            "*kindle*",
            "*tinder*",
            "*flint*",
            "*wood*",
            "*brush*",
            "*warm*",
            "*burn*",
            "*light*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You build the fire back up out of what the camp left behind — char, dry brush, a broken strap that burns badly. It catches. Behind the windbreak the cold goes out of the ground, and for a while nothing in this place is hunting you, which is worth more than the fire is.\n\nYou sleep, and wake stiff, and whole."
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "heal",
              "parameters": [
                "full"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": "The Deep Passage",
      "description": "The passage runs deep into the rock. Far ahead, something shifts.",
      "descriptionWhen": [
        {
          "ifNot": [
            "monster:cave troll"
          ],
          "description": "The passage runs deep into the rock, and nothing in it moves. Where the roof comes down there is a wide dark patch on the stone that is not damp, and beside it, under the overhang, a scooped-out place worn smooth by something that lay down in the same spot every night for longer than the camp has been cold.\n\nCold air comes all the way down the passage from the north now, with nothing standing in it to break the draught."
        }
      ],
      "connections": {
        "south": 2,
        "north": 5
      },
      "monster": "cave troll",
      "interactions": [
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-bone-already-given",
          "if": [
            "fed-the-troll"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*bone*",
            "*feed*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "It is still down over the first one, and it will be for a while yet. You have had what you came for off it. Whether you take the rest is your business."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-bone-give",
          "once": true,
          "scope": "player",
          "if": [
            "carrying:bone",
            "monster:cave troll"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*bone*",
            "*feed*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You take the bone out and hold it where the thing can see it.\n\nThe head comes round. For a moment nothing at all happens and you understand exactly how bad an idea this could still turn out to be. Then you underarm it onto the stone between you, and the troll is on it before it stops rolling — down on both knees, the bone in both fists, gone somewhere else entirely, making a low steady noise that has nothing to do with you.\n\nThe cord at its throat hangs slack and forward while it works. You lift the key off it with two fingers.\n\nThe whistle is on the same cord, and you would have to get your hand right in past its jaw to take that, and it is already looking up."
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "removeitems",
              "parameters": [
                "bone"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addItems",
              "parameters": [
                "key"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addcondition",
              "scope": "player",
              "parameters": [
                "fed-the-troll"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-bone-no-troll",
          "if": [
            "carrying:bone"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*bone*",
            "*feed*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You stand in an empty passage holding out a bone. There is nothing here to take it from you.\n\nOnly the place where it lies down: a patch of floor worn smooth and scooped a little hollow, off to one side where the rock overhangs. Whatever usually fills this passage is not in it, and it has not taken its bedding with it."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-bone-none",
          "if": [
            "monster:cave troll"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*bone*",
            "*feed*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You have nothing to give it. Whatever it has been eating, it has been eating further in than this, and the ends of it are lying around the goblin at the cave mouth."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-bone-none-empty",
          "triggers": [
            "*bone*",
            "*feed*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "There is nothing in this passage to feed. Only the scooped-out place under the overhang where something large has been lying down for a very long time."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-whistle",
          "if": [
            "monster:cave troll"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*whistle*",
            "*steal*",
            "*snatch*",
            "*pickpocket*",
            "*cut the*",
            "*tin*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "It is on the same greased cord as the key, a thumb's width further along, and that thumb's width is the whole of the problem: the key rides forward when the head goes down, and the whistle rides under the jaw.\n\nYou could get two fingers to it. Two fingers is exactly as far in past that jaw as anyone has ever got, and the ones who tried are what it has been eating.\n\nThere is one way to take a thing off a troll that will not put it down, and it is not a quiet one."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-whistle-again",
          "if": [
            "carrying:tin whistle",
            "played-them-out"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*whistle*",
            "*play*",
            "*blow*",
            "*sound*",
            "*tin*",
            "*tune*",
            "*note*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You have already played it here. The rock takes the second note exactly as it took the first, and gives back the same nothing, and that is not a fault in the note.\n\nIt is done. He has had what there is to have. The rest of it is whether the whistle goes up into daylight or stays down here with everything else this place has kept."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-whistle-dead",
          "if": [
            "carrying:tin whistle"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*whistle*",
            "*play*",
            "*blow*",
            "*sound*",
            "*tin*",
            "*tune*",
            "*note*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You put it to your mouth in the place where its owner stopped.\n\nThe note goes out and does not come back. Up at the camp it came off the stones and made a second one; down here the rock takes it in whole and returns nothing at all, and you understand why nobody has heard this since the day it came underground.\n\nThree letters scratched down the barrel with a knife point: an M, and then something, and then what might be an R. They cut the wood in dry and banked the fire and meant to be back by dark. Then they came in here with this in their pocket, and this is as far as they got, and the thing that stopped them wore it at its throat afterwards the way you might keep a coin off a man you beat.\n\nIt is not wearing it now. There is nobody left down here to hear the note but you, and that is the whole of what playing it is for."
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "addcondition",
              "scope": "player",
              "parameters": [
                "played-them-out"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "passage-troll",
          "if": [
            "monster:cave troll"
          ],
          "triggers": [
            "*troll*",
            "*size up*",
            "*size it up*",
            "*thong*",
            "*cord*",
            "*iron*",
            "*throat*",
            "*neck*"
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
